{"id":63584,"date":"2026-08-25T18:54:27","date_gmt":"2026-08-25T17:54:27","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=63584"},"modified":"2026-09-01T01:16:19","modified_gmt":"2026-09-01T00:16:19","slug":"tryka-grand-finale","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/tryka-grand-finale\/","title":{"rendered":"Tryka Grand Finale 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO 1 - DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre O <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Tryka Grand Finale 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Tryka Grand Finale 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>10 de Outubro de 2026<\/strong> na <strong>FIL &#8211; Feira Internacional de Lisboa<\/strong>, no Parque das Na\u00e7\u00f5es. Organizado pela <strong>Tryka Fitness<\/strong>, a grande etapa de encerramento da \u00e9poca internacional re\u00fane atletas continentais e internacionais na capital portuguesa.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com in\u00edcio da primeira vaga agendado para as <strong>08:00<\/strong> de s\u00e1bado, o evento apresenta os formatos oficiais <strong>TRYKA 800<\/strong> (8x800m de corrida com 8 esta\u00e7\u00f5es de exerc\u00edcio) e <strong>TRYKA 500<\/strong> (8x500m). O programa contempla divis\u00f5es <strong>Open, Pro, Duplas, Estafetas e Junior Doubles<\/strong>. Se procuras preparar o teu calend\u00e1rio de provas, podes consultar o nosso direct\u00f3rio de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calendario-de-corridas\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 500;\">calend\u00e1rio de corridas em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO 2 - FICHA T\u00c9CNICA --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">10 de Outubro de 2026 \u00e0s 08:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">FIL &#8211; Feira Internacional de Lisboa (Parque das Na\u00e7\u00f5es), Lisboa<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">TRYKA 800 (8x800m) e TRYKA 500 (8x500m) + 8 Esta\u00e7\u00f5es de Fitness Funcional<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Tryka Fitness<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO 3 - GEOMETRIA & PERCURSO --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f Geometria da Prova &#038; <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Percurso<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A competi\u00e7\u00e3o decorre numa das infraestruturas de excel\u00eancia em <strong>Lisboa<\/strong>, desafiando a resist\u00eancia cardiovascular e muscular em provas intercaladas por esta\u00e7\u00f5es exigentes como SkiErg (1000m), Sled Push, Sled Pull, Rower (1000m) e Burpee Broad Jumps. O circuito encerra com um sprint final de 40m em dire\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e0 meta.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">As bancadas e o pavilh\u00e3o da <strong>FIL<\/strong> oferecem aos espectadores e acompanhantes uma visibilidade privilegiada sobre a arena central. N\u00e3o \u00e9 necess\u00e1ria qualifica\u00e7\u00e3o pr\u00e9via e as bilhetes oficiais s\u00e3o geridos na plataforma <strong>Tryka Fitness<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO 4 - CALCULADORA DE PACE --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card pr-calc-event-banner\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15) 0%, rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.4) 100%); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 20px; padding: 24px 28px; margin-bottom: 24px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 260px;\">\n<h3 style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 6px;\">\u23f1\ufe0f Calcula o teu Tempo Alvo no Tryka Grand Finale 2026<\/h3>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; margin: 0;\">Utiliza a nossa calculadora de pace para definir parciais ideais e gerir o teu ritmo de corrida com precis\u00e3o.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" class=\"pr-calc-event-btn\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 0%, #8B5CF6 100%); color: #0F172A; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 12px; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; white-space: nowrap;\">Calculadora de Pace \u2192<\/a><\/div>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO 5 - ONDE FICAR --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\ud83c\udfe8 Onde Ficar em <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Lisboa<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Para atletas e fam\u00edlias que pretendem pernoitar na regi\u00e3o antes ou depois do <strong>Tryka Grand Finale 2026<\/strong>, recomendamos reservas antecipadas em zonas estrat\u00e9gicas de Lisboa:<\/p>\n<ul style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><strong>Zonas da Partida &#038; Meta (FIL &#8211; Feira Internacional de Lisboa (Parque das Na\u00e7\u00f5es)):<\/strong> Escolha ideal para quem prefere desloca\u00e7\u00f5es r\u00e1pidas no dia do evento.<\/li>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><strong>Centro Urbano de Lisboa:<\/strong> Excelente variedade de alojamento local, hot\u00e9is e restaura\u00e7\u00e3o tradicional.<\/li>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><strong>Eixos de Acesso R\u00e1pido:<\/strong> Op\u00e7\u00e3o conveniente para quem viaja no distrito\/regi\u00e3o de Lisboa.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO 6 - GASTRONOMIA & ACOMPANHANTES --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\ud83c\udf0d Sobre o Local &#038; <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Gastronomia Regional<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A regi\u00e3o de <strong>Lisboa<\/strong> oferece um patrim\u00f3nio cultural e paisag\u00edstico rico. Ap\u00f3s o esfor\u00e7o da prova, os participantes podem desfrutar dos sabores locais da gastronomia regional, como <em>Past\u00e9is de Bel\u00e9m, Bacalhau \u00e0 Br\u00e1s e gastronomia do Parque das Na\u00e7\u00f5es<\/em> em restaurantes t\u00edpicos da localidade.<\/p>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 20px; margin-top: 20px;\">\n<h3 style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83d\udc65 Guia de Acompanhantes &#038; Espectadores<\/h3>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Os acompanhantes e fam\u00edlias podem assistir \u00e0 prova e apoiar os atletas em locais estrat\u00e9gicos como <strong>Bancadas principais do pavilh\u00e3o da FIL, arena central e zonas de transi\u00e7\u00e3o<\/strong>, desfrutando da anima\u00e7\u00e3o e do acolhimento local.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO CROSS-LINKING --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Outras Provas Recomendadas na <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Mesma Regi\u00e3o<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Descubra tamb\u00e9m outros eventos desportivos de relevo agendados para a \u00e9poca: <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-lisboa\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 500;\">outras corridas e trails recomendados em Lisboa<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO 7 - FAQS ALINHADAS COM FICHA T\u00c9CNICA --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas Frequentes <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">(Tryka Grand Finale 2026)<\/span><\/h2>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;\">\n<details style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data e o hor\u00e1rio de partida do Tryka Grand Finale 2026?<\/summary>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px; margin-bottom: 0;\">O evento realiza-se no dia <strong>10 de Outubro de 2026 (S\u00e1bado)<\/strong>, com partidas agendadas a partir das <strong>08:00<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<details style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde se realiza a prova e qual \u00e9 o concelho e distrito?<\/summary>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px; margin-bottom: 0;\">A partida tem lugar em <strong>FIL &#8211; Feira Internacional de Lisboa (Parque das Na\u00e7\u00f5es)<\/strong>, no distrito de <strong>Lisboa<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<details style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias oficiais dispon\u00edveis no Tryka Grand Finale 2026?<\/summary>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px; margin-bottom: 0;\">O programa oficial disponibiliza as dist\u00e2ncias de <strong>TRYKA 800 (8x800m) e TRYKA 500 (8x500m) + 8 Esta\u00e7\u00f5es de Fitness Funcional<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<details style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem \u00e9 a entidade organizadora do Tryka Grand Finale 2026?<\/summary>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o do evento \u00e9 assegurada por <strong>Tryka Fitness<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<details style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar os resultados e as fotografias da prova?<\/summary>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px; margin-bottom: 0;\">As classifica\u00e7\u00f5es finais e os tempos oficiais poder\u00e3o ser acedidos na p\u00e1gina da prova no portal <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 500;\">Portugal Running<\/a> ap\u00f3s o encerramento do evento. A fotorreportagem e as galerias de imagens poder\u00e3o ser pesquisadas atrav\u00e9s dos canais oficiais da organiza\u00e7\u00e3o e nas plataformas parceiras de cobertura fotogr\u00e1fica desportiva.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: SCHEMAS JSON-LD (SportsEvent + FAQPage) --><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\",\n  \"name\": \"Tryka Grand Finale 2026\",\n  \"startDate\": \"2026-10-10T08:00:00+00:00\",\n  \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/tryka-grand-finale\/\",\n  \"location\": {\n    \"@type\": \"Place\",\n    \"name\": \"FIL - Feira Internacional de Lisboa (Parque das Na\u00e7\u00f5es)\",\n    \"address\": {\n      \"@type\": \"PostalAddress\",\n      \"addressLocality\": \"Lisboa\",\n      \"addressRegion\": \"Lisboa\",\n      \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"organizer\": {\n    \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n    \"name\": \"Tryka Fitness\"\n  }\n}\n<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [\n    {\n  